#. Description of the plugin
#: nvoos-forge-bridge.php
msgid "Rebuild webhook + preview tokens for sites generated with the NV oOS Astro Forge. Fires a signed GitHub repository_dispatch when content changes (debounced), verifies inbound rebuild triggers with HMAC, and mints single-use preview tokens."
